# The image builds its own dependencies: `npm install` runs before `COPY . .`, so anything the host
# already installed here would overwrite it. That matters more than build speed - the host is glibc
# and the build stage is node:20-alpine, so a copied node_modules brings native binaries (rollup's,
# among others) that cannot load under musl, and the build fails inside the container for a reason
# that is invisible from outside it.
node_modules
dist

.git
.gitignore
*.log
*.md
coverage
